      ],
      "source_type": "text",
      "source_sentence": "Another type of controlled radical polymerization process was also reported by Ishihara.<sup>[19]</sup> Preparation of a high-density poly(MPC) brush has been reported by Iwasaki<sup>[20]</sup> and $\\mathrm { B r a s h } ^ { [ 2 1 ] }$using surface-initiated ATRP from a silicon substrate, immobilized 2-bromoisobutylate group.",
