        915.0
      ],
      "source_type": "text",
      "source_sentence": "Figure 4 shows adhesion and lateral force for the high-density poly(MPC) brush surface measured by AFM using a colloidal probe in aqueous solution.",
      "evidence_id": "ev00015",
